 !                                                                               
 ! This test calculates the spin-orbit components of the 2P state of Fluorine,   
 ! using a COSCI wavefunction.                                                   
 !                                                                               
 **DIRAC                                                                         
 .TITLE                                                                          
 Fluorine atom.                                                                  
 .WAVE F                                                                         
 **GENERAL                                                                       
 .PCMOUT                                                                         
 **HAMILTONIAN                                                                   
 .LVCORR                                                                         
 **WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                
 .DHF                                                                            
 .RESOLVE                                                                        
 *DHFCAL                                                                         
 .CLOSED SHELL                                                                   
 4 0                                                                             
 .OPEN S                                                                         
 1                                                                               
 5/0,6                                                                           
 .MAXITR                                                                         
 25                                                                              
 *END OF                                                                         
                                                                                 
  $GOSCIP IPRNT=5 &END                                                           


 **************************************************************************
 ***************************** Fluorine atom. *****************************
 **************************************************************************

 Jobs in this run:
   * Wave function
HAMSCAN: Found keyword .LVCORR


